{"id":"candy-pop","title":"Candy Pop — Playful Shop","description":"A sugar-high playful shop — candy pastel-bright colours, floating shapes, bouncy buttons, emoji products and a working cart counter with confetti bursts. For kids brands, fun apps and sweet shops.","tags":["candy","playful","shop"],"type":"code","link":null,"updated":"2026-10-11T19:01:41.424Z","docs":{"file":"design.md","raw":"---\ntitle: Candy Pop — Playful Shop\ndescription: A sugar-high playful shop — candy pastel-bright colours, floating shapes, bouncy buttons, emoji products and a working cart counter with confetti bursts. For kids brands, fun apps and sweet shops.\ntags: [candy, playful, shop]\norder: 16\n---\n\n# Candy Pop — Playful Shop\n\nMaximum fun per pixel: pink/mint/yellow/lilac palette, everything rounded and wobbling,\nemoji products, and a cart that counts up with a confetti explosion when you buy.\n\n## Tokens\n\n| Token | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Background | `#fff6f9` soft pink-white |\n| Candy palette | pink `#ff6fb5` · yellow `#ffd93d` · green `#6bcb77` · blue `#4d96ff` · lilac `#c780fa` |\n| Shape language | circles + blobs, radius 20px+, everything floats |\n| Type | system sans, 800-weight bouncy headline |\n\n## Interaction\n\n- Floating background shapes drift endlessly\n- \"Grab a bag\" button fires a **confetti burst** (vanilla JS particles)\n- Add-to-cart increments a bouncing counter badge\n- Product cards wiggle on hover\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — self-contained, no dependencies, works offline.\n","body":"\n# Candy Pop — Playful Shop\n\nMaximum fun per pixel: pink/mint/yellow/lilac palette, everything rounded and wobbling,\nemoji products, and a cart that counts up with a confetti explosion when you buy.\n\n## Tokens\n\n| Token | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Background | `#fff6f9` soft pink-white |\n| Candy palette | pink `#ff6fb5` · yellow `#ffd93d` · green `#6bcb77` · blue `#4d96ff` · lilac `#c780fa` |\n| Shape language | circles + blobs, radius 20px+, everything floats |\n| Type | system sans, 800-weight bouncy headline |\n\n## Interaction\n\n- Floating background shapes drift endlessly\n- \"Grab a bag\" button fires a **confetti burst** (vanilla JS particles)\n- Add-to-cart increments a bouncing counter badge\n- Product cards wiggle on hover\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — self-contained, no dependencies, works offline.\n"},"files":[{"path":"index.html","lang":"html","content":"\u003c!DOCTYPE html>\n\u003chtml lang=\"en\">\n\u003chead>\n\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n\u003cmeta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n\u003ctitle>SugarLab — Candy Pop\u003c/title>\n\u003cstyle>\n  :root { --pink: #ff6fb5; --yellow: #ffd93d; --green: #6bcb77; --blue: #4d96ff; --lilac: #c780fa; --ink: #3d2b3d; --bg: #fff6f9; }\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  body { font-family: \"Segoe UI\", system-ui, sans-serif; background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink); overflow-x: hidden; }\n\n  /* floating shapes */\n  .shape { position: fixed; border-radius: 50%; opacity: 0.5; animation: floaty 7s ease-in-out infinite alternate; pointer-events: none; z-index: 0; }\n  .s1 { width: 70px; height: 70px; background: var(--yellow); top: 12%; left: 6%; }\n  .s2 { width: 42px; height: 42px; background: var(--blue); top: 60%; left: 4%; animation-delay: -2s; }\n  .s3 { width: 56px; height: 56px; background: var(--green); top: 18%; right: 8%; animation-delay: -4s; }\n  .s4 { width: 34px; height: 34px; background: var(--pink); bottom: 12%; right: 12%; animation-delay: -1s; }\n  .s5 { width: 46px; height: 46px; background: var(--lilac); bottom: 30%; left: 10%; animation-delay: -3s; }\n  @keyframes floaty { to { transform: translateY(-26px) rotate(18deg); } }\n\n  .wrap { max-width: 940px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 22px; position: relative; z-index: 1; }\n  nav { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 20px 0; }\n  .logo { font-size: 21px; font-weight: 800; }\n  .logo .candy { display: inline-block; animation: wiggle 2.2s ease-in-out infinite; }\n  @keyframes wiggle { 0%, 100% { transform: rotate(-8deg); } 50% { transform: rotate(10deg); } }\n  .cart { position: relative; background: var(--pink); color: #fff; border: 0; font: inherit; font-weight: 700; font-size: 13.5px; padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 999px; cursor: pointer; box-shadow: 0 6px 0 #e2549b; transition: transform 0.1s; }\n  .cart:active { transform: translateY(4px); box-shadow: 0 2px 0 #e2549b; }\n  .cart .badge { position: absolute; top: -8px; right: -8px; background: var(--yellow); color: var(--ink); width: 26px; height: 26px; border-radius: 50%; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 12.5px; border: 2.5px solid #fff; }\n  .cart.bounce .badge { animation: bounce 0.5s; }\n  @keyframes bounce { 30% { transform: scale(1.5); } 60% { transform: scale(0.85); } }\n\n  header { text-align: center; padding: 46px 0 40px; }\n  h1 { font-size: clamp(38px, 7vw, 64px); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.05; }\n  h1 .c1 { color: var(--pink); } h1 .c2 { color: var(--blue); } h1 .c3 { color: var(--green); }\n  .sub { margin: 16px auto 28px; max-width: 460px; font-size: 16px; color: #7a5c72; }\n  .big-cta { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 800; padding: 15px 34px; border: 0; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--green); color: #fff; cursor: pointer; box-shadow: 0 7px 0 #4ea75a; transition: transform 0.1s; position: relative; z-index: 2; }\n  .big-cta:hover { animation: wiggle 0.5s ease-in-out infinite; }\n  .big-cta:active { transform: translateY(5px); box-shadow: 0 2px 0 #4ea75a; }\n\n  .products { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 20px; padding: 30px 0 50px; }\n  .prod { background: #fff; border-radius: 24px; padding: 24px 20px; text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(190, 120, 160, 0.18); transition: transform 0.2s; }\n  .prod:hover { transform: rotate(-2deg) scale(1.04); }\n  .prod .face { width: 84px; height: 84px; margin: 0 auto 14px; border-radius: 50%; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 40px; }\n  .f1 { background: #ffe3f1; } .f2 { background: #fff8d6; } .f3 { background: #e3f6e6; }\n  .prod h3 { font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 4px; }\n  .prod .desc { font-size: 12.5px; color: #9a7f92; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n  .prod .price { font-weight: 800; font-size: 18px; color: var(--pink); margin-bottom: 12px; }\n  .add { border: 0; background: var(--blue); color: #fff; font: inherit; font-weight: 700; font-size: 12.5px; padding: 8px 18px; border-radius: 999px; cursor: pointer; box-shadow: 0 4px 0 #2f6fd1; }\n  .add:active { transform: translateY(3px); box-shadow: 0 1px 0 #2f6fd1; }\n\n  .funline { text-align: center; font-size: 14px; color: #9a7f92; padding-bottom: 60px; }\n  .confetti { position: fixed; width: 10px; height: 10px; top: -12px; z-index: 50; pointer-events: none; animation: fall 1.6s ease-in forwards; }\n  @keyframes fall { to { transform: translateY(105vh) rotate(720deg); opacity: 0.6; } }\n\n  @media (max-width: 700px) { .products { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }\n\u003c/style>\n\u003c/head>\n\u003cbody>\n  \u003cdiv class=\"shape s1\">\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"shape s2\">\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"shape s3\">\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"shape s4\">\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"shape s5\">\u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cdiv class=\"wrap\">\n    \u003cnav>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"logo\">\u003cspan class=\"candy\">🍬\u003c/span> SugarLab\u003c/div>\n      \u003cbutton class=\"cart\" id=\"cartBtn\">🛒 Cart \u003cspan class=\"badge\" id=\"cartCount\">0\u003c/span>\u003c/button>\n    \u003c/nav>\n\n    \u003cheader>\n      \u003ch1>Life is short.\u003cbr>Eat the \u003cspan class=\"c1\">rain\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"c2\">bow\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"c3\">.\u003c/span>\u003c/h1>\n      \u003cp class=\"sub\">Handmade candy with colours loud enough to hear. Cooked in small batches, shipped with love (and bubble wrap).\u003c/p>\n      \u003cbutton class=\"big-cta\" id=\"partyBtn\">🎉 Grab a bag!\u003c/button>\n    \u003c/header>\n\n    \u003cdiv class=\"products\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"prod\">\u003cdiv class=\"face f1\">🍭\u003c/div>\u003ch3>Unicorn Swirl\u003c/h3>\u003cdiv class=\"desc\">strawberry + bubblegum swirl pop\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"price\">RM 6.90\u003c/div>\u003cbutton class=\"add\">Add to cart\u003c/button>\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"prod\">\u003cdiv class=\"face f2\">🐸\u003c/div>\u003ch3>Gummy Frogs\u003c/h3>\u003cdiv class=\"desc\">sour lime frogs that stare back\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"price\">RM 8.50\u003c/div>\u003cbutton class=\"add\">Add to cart\u003c/button>\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"prod\">\u003cdiv class=\"face f3\">🫐\u003c/div>\u003ch3>Galaxy Berries\u003c/h3>\u003cdiv class=\"desc\">blueberry clouds, zero gravity\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"price\">RM 7.20\u003c/div>\u003cbutton class=\"add\">Add to cart\u003c/button>\u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n\n    \u003cdiv class=\"funline\">made with sugar, food colouring & questionable life choices 🍬\u003c/div>\n  \u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cscript>\n    // cart counter with bounce\n    let n = 0;\n    const badge = document.getElementById('cartCount'), cart = document.getElementById('cartBtn');\n    document.querySelectorAll('.add').forEach(b => b.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      n++;\n      badge.textContent = n;\n      cart.classList.remove('bounce');\n      void cart.offsetWidth;\n      cart.classList.add('bounce');\n      toast('Added to cart! 🍬');\n    }));\n    document.getElementById('cartBtn').addEventListener('click', () => toast(n ? 'You have ' + n + ' sweet(s) in the cart!' : 'Cart is empty — grab something!'));\n\n    // confetti burst\n    const colors = ['#ff6fb5', '#ffd93d', '#6bcb77', '#4d96ff', '#c780fa'];\n    function confetti(x, y) {\n      for (let i = 0; i \u003c 40; i++) {\n        const c = document.createElement('div');\n        c.className = 'confetti';\n        c.style.background = colors[i % colors.length];\n        c.style.left = (x + (Math.random() - 0.5) * 120) + 'px';\n        c.style.top = y + 'px';\n        c.style.borderRadius = Math.random() > 0.5 ? '50%' : '2px';\n        c.style.animationDelay = (Math.random() * 0.2) + 's';\n        document.body.appendChild(c);\n        setTimeout(() => c.remove(), 2000);\n      }\n    }\n    document.getElementById('partyBtn').addEventListener('click', e => {\n      const r = e.target.getBoundingClientRect();\n      confetti(r.left + r.width / 2, r.top);\n      toast('YAAAY party time! 🎉');\n    });\n\n    // tiny toast\n    let tt;\n    function toast(m) {\n      let t = document.getElementById('toast');\n      if (!t) { t = document.createElement('div'); t.id = 'toast'; t.style.cssText = 'position:fixed;bottom:24px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);background:#3d2b3d;color:#fff;padding:10px 20px;border-radius:999px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;z-index:60'; document.body.appendChild(t); }\n      t.textContent = m;\n      clearTimeout(tt);\n      tt = setTimeout(() => t.remove(), 1800);\n    }\n  \u003c/script>\n\u003c/body>\n\u003c/html>\n"}],"preview":{"file":"index.html","html":"\u003c!DOCTYPE html>\n\u003chtml lang=\"en\">\n\u003chead>\u003cscript>(function(){try{window.localStorage.getItem(\"__probe__\")}catch(e){var s={};var o={getItem:function(k){return k in s?s[k]:null},setItem:function(k,v){s[k]=String(v)},removeItem:function(k){delete s[k]},clear:function(){s={}},key:function(i){return Object.keys(s)[i]||null}};Object.defineProperty(o,\"length\",{get:function(){return Object.keys(s).length},configurable:true});try{Object.defineProperty(window,\"localStorage\",{value:o,configurable:true})}catch(e2){}}})();\u003c/script>\n\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n\u003cmeta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n\u003ctitle>SugarLab — Candy Pop\u003c/title>\n\u003cstyle>\n  :root { --pink: #ff6fb5; --yellow: #ffd93d; --green: #6bcb77; --blue: #4d96ff; --lilac: #c780fa; --ink: #3d2b3d; --bg: #fff6f9; }\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  body { font-family: \"Segoe UI\", system-ui, sans-serif; background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink); overflow-x: hidden; }\n\n  /* floating shapes */\n  .shape { position: fixed; border-radius: 50%; opacity: 0.5; animation: floaty 7s ease-in-out infinite alternate; pointer-events: none; z-index: 0; }\n  .s1 { width: 70px; height: 70px; background: var(--yellow); top: 12%; left: 6%; }\n  .s2 { width: 42px; height: 42px; background: var(--blue); top: 60%; left: 4%; animation-delay: -2s; }\n  .s3 { width: 56px; height: 56px; background: var(--green); top: 18%; right: 8%; animation-delay: -4s; }\n  .s4 { width: 34px; height: 34px; background: var(--pink); bottom: 12%; right: 12%; animation-delay: -1s; }\n  .s5 { width: 46px; height: 46px; background: var(--lilac); bottom: 30%; left: 10%; animation-delay: -3s; }\n  @keyframes floaty { to { transform: translateY(-26px) rotate(18deg); } }\n\n  .wrap { max-width: 940px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 22px; position: relative; z-index: 1; }\n  nav { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 20px 0; }\n  .logo { font-size: 21px; font-weight: 800; }\n  .logo .candy { display: inline-block; animation: wiggle 2.2s ease-in-out infinite; }\n  @keyframes wiggle { 0%, 100% { transform: rotate(-8deg); } 50% { transform: rotate(10deg); } }\n  .cart { position: relative; background: var(--pink); color: #fff; border: 0; font: inherit; font-weight: 700; font-size: 13.5px; padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 999px; cursor: pointer; box-shadow: 0 6px 0 #e2549b; transition: transform 0.1s; }\n  .cart:active { transform: translateY(4px); box-shadow: 0 2px 0 #e2549b; }\n  .cart .badge { position: absolute; top: -8px; right: -8px; background: var(--yellow); color: var(--ink); width: 26px; height: 26px; border-radius: 50%; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 12.5px; border: 2.5px solid #fff; }\n  .cart.bounce .badge { animation: bounce